{
  "schema": "loom.runtime_profile/1",
  "domain": "resource_projection",
  "revision": 3,
  "description": "Native resource graph kinds and predicates. A profile changes projection vocabulary, never source retention, transport, runtime activation, privacy or domain parser selection. Missing fields are errors; this is the canonical source for generated embedding. Revision 2 preserves observed source array indices; legacy byte-only units remain explicitly unit-relative. Prior graph identities remain immutable. Revision 3 snapshots retain the existing full export-mapping DTO inside last_successful; prior graph/snapshot interpretations remain identifiable.",
